pageType: content
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$bg"
notes: |-
  七项驾驶行为评价指标：选取逻辑（驾驶行为→车速/加速度→驱动电机能耗），
  表 3 给出符号与计算式；P_r 与能耗正相关，其余六项负相关。
elements:
  - elementId: chapter-bar
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [0, 0, 960, 56]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: { type: solid, color: "$primary" }
  - elementId: chapter-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [48, 14, 720, 28]
    content:
      fontFamily: "LXGW Neo XiHei"
      fontSize: 18
      color: "#FFFFFF"
      bold: true
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: '02. 数据与方法 —— 七项驾驶行为指标'
  - elementId: chapter-brand
    elementType: text
    bounds: [736, 20, 176, 16]
    content:
      fontFamily: "LXGW Neo XiHei"
      fontSize: 8.8
      color: "$accent6"
      align: [right, top]
      wrap: false
      text: EV RANGE · 学术报告
  - elementId: title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [48, 70, 864, 34]
    content:
      style: "$title"
      wrap: false
      text: 七项指标不描述“风格”，只量化可赋权的行为强度
  - elementId: subtitle
    elementType: text
    bounds: [48, 104, 864, 16]
    content:
      style: "$caption"
      fontSize: 9.6
      wrap: false
      text: 均值、占比、标准差：三类统计量覆盖车速与加速度两个维度
  - elementId: logic-card
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [48, 132, 304, 168]
    shapeName: roundRect
    adjustments: [10000]
    fill: { type: solid, color: "#FFFFFF" }
    border: { style: solid, width: 1, color: "$line" }
    shadow: { blur: 10, color: "#1F5FBF14", offset: [0, 2] }
  - elementId: logic-label
    elementType: text
    bounds: [66, 146, 268, 16]
    content:
      style: "$label"
      fontSize: 8.6
      wrap: false
      text: 选取逻辑
  - elementId: logic-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [66, 168, 268, 86]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      fontSize: 9.8
      lineHeight: 1.6
      text: 驾驶行为变化引起车速与加速度变化，进而改变驱动电机能耗。以短行驶片段内的均值、占比与标准差刻画变化特征，兼顾指标的可获取性与可操作性。
  - elementId: logic-types
    elementType: text
    bounds: [66, 262, 268, 30]
    content:
      style: "$caption"
      fontSize: 8.4
      lineHeight: 1.45
      text: 均值：V<sub>m</sub>、a<sub>m</sub>｜占比：P<sub>a</sub>、P<sub>h</sub>、P<sub>r</sub>｜标准差：V<sub>std</sub>、a<sub>std</sub>
  - elementId: dir-card
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [48, 316, 304, 154]
    shapeName: roundRect
    adjustments: [10000]
    fill: { type: solid, color: "$primarySoft" }
    border: { style: solid, width: 1, color: "$primaryTint" }
  - elementId: dir-label
    elementType: text
    bounds: [66, 330, 268, 16]
    content:
      style: "$label"
      fontSize: 8.6
      wrap: false
      text: 与能耗的相关方向
  - elementId: dir-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [66, 352, 268, 58]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      fontSize: 9.6
      lineHeight: 1.55
      text: |-
        <p><strong>负相关</strong>：P<sub>a</sub>、P<sub>h</sub>、V<sub>m</sub>、V<sub>std</sub>、a<sub>m</sub>、a<sub>std</sub>。</p>
        <p style="margin-top:4px"><strong>正相关</strong>：能量回收占比 P<sub>r</sub>——计算因子前先作趋势反向化。</p>
  - elementId: dir-role
    elementType: text
    bounds: [66, 418, 268, 32]
    content:
      style: "$caption"
      fontSize: 8.6
      lineHeight: 1.45
      text: 7 项加权求和 → 每个片段唯一的连续标签 Q。
  - elementId: table-caption
    elementType: text
    bounds: [384, 144, 512, 16]
    content:
      style: "$caption"
      fontSize: 8.6
      wrap: false
      text: |-
        <p><span style="color:$accent;font-weight:bold;">表 3</span>　七项驾驶行为评价指标与计算式</p>
  - elementId: table-3
    elementType: table
    bounds: [384, 166, 512, 285.5]
    columnWidths: [0.09, 0.17, 0.28, 0.46]
    rowHeights: [0.10, 0.12, 0.12, 0.12, 0.12, 0.12, 0.12, 0.18]
    style: "$formula"
    rows:
      - - text: 序号
        - text: 符号
        - text: 评价指标
        - text: 计算公式
      - - text: "1"
        - text: |-
            <p>\(P_{\mathrm{a}}\)</p>
        - text: 急加速时长占比
        - text: |-
            <p>\(P_{\mathrm{a}} = \frac{t_{\mathrm{a}}}{T}\)</p>
      - - text: "2"
        - text: |-
            <p>\(P_{\mathrm{h}}\)</p>
        - text: 高速时长占比
        - text: |-
            <p>\(P_{\mathrm{h}} = \frac{t_{\mathrm{h}}}{T}\)</p>
      - - text: "3"
        - text: |-
            <p>\(P_{\mathrm{r}}\)</p>
        - text: 能量回收占比
        - text: |-
            <p>\(P_{\mathrm{r}} = \frac{E_{\mathrm{r}}}{E}\)</p>
      - - text: "4"
        - text: |-
            <p>\(V_{\mathrm{m}}\)</p>
        - text: 车速均值
        - text: |-
            <p>\(V_{\mathrm{m}} = \frac{\sum_{i=1}^{n} v_i}{n}\)</p>
      - - text: "5"
        - text: |-
            <p>\(V_{\mathrm{std}}\)</p>
        - text: 车速标准差
        - text: |-
            <p style="font-size:7px">\(V_{\mathrm{std}} = \sqrt{\frac{\sum_{i=1}^{n} (v_i - V_{\mathrm{m}})^2}{n}}\)</p>
      - - text: "6"
        - text: |-
            <p>\(a_{\mathrm{m}}\)</p>
        - text: 加速度均值
        - text: |-
            <p>\(a_{\mathrm{m}} = \frac{\sum_{i=1}^{n} a_i}{n}\)</p>
      - - text: "7"
        - text: |-
            <p>\(a_{\mathrm{std}}\)</p>
        - text: 加速度标准差
        - text: |-
            <p style="font-size:7px">\(a_{\mathrm{std}} = \sqrt{\frac{\sum_{i=1}^{n} (a_i - a_{\mathrm{m}})^2}{n}}\)</p>
  - elementId: table-note
    elementType: text
    bounds: [384, 474, 512, 12]
    content:
      style: "$caption"
      fontSize: 7.6
      text: |-
        <p>T 为片段总时长；t<sub>a</sub>、t<sub>h</sub> 为急加速、高速累计时长；E<sub>r</sub>、E 为回收能耗与片段总能耗。</p>
  - elementId: footer-line
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [48, 502, 864, 1]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: { type: solid, color: "$line" }
  - elementId: footer-left
    elementType: text
    bounds: [48, 507, 640, 12]
    content:
      style: "$nav"
      wrap: false
      text: 基于驾驶行为量化特征的电动汽车剩余续驶里程预测 · 《新能源车辆工程学报》
  - elementId: footer-page
    elementType: text
    bounds: [800, 506, 112, 14]
    content:
      fontFamily: "LXGW Neo XiHei"
      fontSize: 8.5
      color: "$primary"
      bold: true
      align: [right, top]
      wrap: false
      text: 05 / 15
